      "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 17 2025 15:02:29 GMT+0000",
      "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\">5 benefits of powered equipment you don’t want to ignore</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">There’s nothing predictable about the world of fire and rescue but having the right equipment in place can make all the difference. A connected, powered fleet not only supports your crew but your patients, too. In this article, we explore the top benefits of using powered gear, like <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-pro-2.html\">Power-PRO 2</a>, <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/power-load.html\">Power-LOAD</a>, <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/lucas-3.html\">LUCAS</a>, <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifepak-35.html\">LIFEPAK 35</a> and the <a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/emergency-care/products/lifenet-system.html\">LIFENET System</a>, and how they can help departments like yours operate safely and efficiently. <br>\n</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Want to dive deeper into how our powered gear can support your department? Fill out the form below to get full access to the article.</span></p>\n",
      "jcr:lastModified": "Fri Jul 18 2025 19:30:25 GMT+0000",
      "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
      "textIsRich": "true"
    },
